{"mangaRefs":["file-731-733"],"locationRefs":["location-beika-town"],"summary":{"en":"On the day of the heist, Conan is confronted by Kid in the bathroom stalls who reveals he was able to bypass the metal detectors by removing the lead from the pistol. As Kid leaves, Conan overhears Tarumi and his appraiser hoping Kid succeeds in his plot. Kid appears at the announced time and publicly claims he is cleaning up before setting off the fire sprinklers; he blends into the crowd who are also soaked from the rain and makes his escape.","zhHans":"怪盗基德相关作品以预告、变装、宝石目标和柯南的追踪对决为核心，属于独立角色专题线。","zhHant":"","legacy":true,"sourcePage":"Conan_&_Kid's_Battle_For_Ryoma's_Treasure","sourceQuote":true},"characters":["character-conan-edogawa","character-kaito-kid","character-ran-mouri","character-shintaro-chaki","character-yoko-okino","character-jirokichi-suzuki","character-kaitou-kid","character-sonoko-suzuki","character-ginzo-nakamori","character-naomichi-mugikura","character-yukiko-kudo"],"organizations":[],"locations":[],"gadgets":[],"caseTypes":["disguise","heist","rival-detectives"],"sources":["src-abiting-conan-database","src-detective-conan-world-anime"],"detailStatus":"reviewed","coverage":{"directory":true,"basicFacts":true,"structure":true,"deepSpoilers":true},"raw":{"manga":"Vol. 70","specialLabel":null,"rawIndex":627,"dcwMangaSource":"V70 - F2~4(731-733)","dcwMangaKind":"manga","dcwAirDate":"August 27, 2011"},"season":16,"solvedByRaw":"Conan Edogawa","solvedBy":"character-conan-edogawa","castNames":["Conan Edogawa","Kaitou Kid","Ran Mouri","Sonoko Suzuki","Ginzo Nakamori","Shintaro Chaki","Jirokichi Suzuki","Yukiko Kudo","Phantom Lady","Naomichi Mugikura","Kaito Kuroba","Masanosuke Hanamura","Detective Konno","Yoko Okino"],"dcwL3Source":{"season":"Conan_&_Kid's_Battle_For_Ryoma's_Treasure"}}